I walk out onto the street.
It is a normal morning.
I walk down to the bus stop.
Many people are standing there.
They are also waiting for the bus.
I look down the road.
A big yellow bus arrives.
It is bus number five.
The bus stops in front of me.
The doors open.
I step inside the bus.
I find my travel card in my bag.
I scan the blue card on the machine.
The machine beeps.
I walk to the back of the bus.
I find an empty seat by the window.
I sit down.
I look at the people in the street.
We drive through the busy streets.
I am ready for a new workday.
